# flutter-utility-app

A simple educational utility app built for learning Flutter & Dart.

### What I did:
- Set up Flutter environment on Windows 10/11
- Created basic UI with 2 buttons to test environment config and UI rendering
- Learned debugging with try-catch and state management using setState

### Tech Stack:
- Flutter, Dart, Material Design

### How to Run:
1. flutter pub get
2. flutter run

